{"parse": {"title": "Anniversary Star", "pageid": 4044, "revid": 37262, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>anniversary star</b> is an obtainable item introduced in the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Anniversary</a> update which can be obtained by defeating NPCS in any gamemode or by completing the <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons#Anniversary_Island\" title=\"Dungeons\">anniversary island</a> stage. An enemy will be wearing a party hat if they're going to drop an anniversary star.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">15-40 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">15-40 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"dottedText\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Star Remnant\"><img alt=\"Star Remnant\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fd/Star_Remnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250102035557\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Star Remnant.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Remnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> Star Remnant</span><br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"dottedText\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Stat Cube\"><img alt=\"Stat Cube\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/46/Stat_Cube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230228230815\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Stat Cube.png\" data-image-key=\"Stat_Cube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> Stat Cube</span><br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"stas-tooltip\" data-param=\"Star Fruit Capsule\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Star_Fruit_Capsule.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Star Fruit Capsule.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-height=\"24\">Star Fruit Capsule</span></a></span> <span class=\"dottedText\"><a href=\"/wiki/Items#Materials\" title=\"Items\">Star Fruit Capsule</a></span></span><br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/36/Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png/revision/latest?cb=20250104040756\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Anniversary Starry Ball\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Anniversary Starry Ball.png\" data-image-key=\"Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/36/Anniversary_Starry_Ball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250104040756\" /></a></span>Anniversary Starry Ball<br /></span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022203644\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.142 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1865/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argumen